  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Circular Economy for Household Organic Waste (CE4HOW)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We will create an urban waste collection system in Kakamega, Kenya, to feed 4,000 ton/pa of household organic waste into a new waste processing plant. This will be converted into organic fertilizer, providing regenerative inputs for local farmers, who in turn supply food to the urban area, creating a circular economy. We will incentivise household separation of waste, creatie privately run aggregation centres that can profitably integrate waste into the plant&apos;s supply chain &amp; create decent jobs.</narrative>
  </description>
